      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently the location in the profile only shows some brief info about the instance and gives you an option to join it. \n\nWe should be able to open that instance as one might want to first check for more info.\n\nImportant scenarios:\n\n- World content warnings\n\n- Group's rules\n\nMake the thumbnail and/or title clickable.",
